; WHERE YOU COME IN. The south-west corner of the frontage, outside the loop,
; facing north-east up the restaurant row toward the mall — so the first thing
; on screen is the row you have to fight through and the mass of the mall
; behind it. This is the same spot build_polaris.gd puts its own SpawnPoint,
; kept because it is already the right end of the map; the level's export is
; pointed here so the mission does not depend on which of the two survives a
; rebuild.
