; ── OPTIONAL: the two roofs and the nest. ──
; All three are things that shoot into the court for the whole operation. They
; are optional because the player can choose to eat that instead of spending
; the time, and the fifth wave is where that choice gets settled.
[node name="CinemaRoof" type="Node3D" parent="." node_paths=PackedStringArray("linked_squad_point")]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, -92, 0, 92)
