; ── THE WAY OUT ──────────────────────────────
; The service dock behind the mall. You came in the front and you leave by the
; back, which means the last thing the operation asks is that you cross the
; north lot — where the fourth wave came from and where anything still alive
; from it is standing.
[node name="LevelExit" parent="." instance=ExtResource("9_exit")]
